{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And the sense of \"Is it not to Elohim interpretations?\"</b> For the interpretation of dreams belongs to HaShem, for He knows the future, and He shows in a dream what will be to whom He wills. And if I interpret it for good or for ill, it neither helps nor harms. And since the matter is so, and to HaShem are the interpretations of all dreams, do not be concerned that you tell your dreams to me. And all dreams follow after the mouth — they are the words of an individual:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:31.937587998Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}